efore i know  what sleep means right now  [Music]  schwartz has a handful of clients so far  the difficulty for many elderly  homeowners  lies in tracking down someone to trust  it means the world to me to have  somebody  that can help me because it's very hard  to get anybody to help you  especially if you're a senior you get a  lot of people that take advantage of you  or do something but don't finish it  alfred byer reached out to schwartz  after struggling with  carpal tunnel and back pain when was the  last time you were able to mow your lawn  quite a while ago the last time i cut  the top of the bushes because the  neighbors complained he said this guy is  too lazy to cut the bush  so i forced myself to cut the tap in  front of the bushes  as word has gotten out a backlog is  beginning to build  with more requests for help coming in  but so too have calls  offering help as volunteers similar boat  as me recently laid off as a result of  the pandemic there's millions of us out  there  so i feel like i'm not the only one that  is kind of in the same boat that has the  equipment to help out  in the meantime short says he's still  actively looking for a full-time job  and wants to see where the site can go  but hopes to continue volunteering  i'm not going to stop by any means i'm  still going to keep it going i'm going  to communicate  with whoever brings on an offer that you  know i'm  going to still want to help out a couple  hours a week just a few more lawns  for a cut above for cbs this morning  saturday  nancy chen east rutherford new jersey

